---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import Header from '../components/Header.astro'
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'
---

<Layout title="Renew your license | Cmdr" description="Keep receiving Cmdr updates for $39 a year.">
    <Header />
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 pt-32 pb-24">
        <header class="mb-12 text-center">
            <h1 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary">Renew your updates</h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary">
                Your license doesn't expire. Renewing keeps the new versions coming.
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-8">
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">Another year of updates</h2>
            <p class="mb-6 text-text-secondary">
                A commercial license includes one year of updates. After that year, the version you already have keeps
                working for as long as you like, and $39 buys another year of new ones. Skipping a year and coming back
                later works fine.
            </p>

            <div class="mb-6 rounded-lg border border-border-subtle bg-background p-4">
                <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
                    <span class="text-text-secondary">One more year of updates</span>
                    <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">$39</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <a
                href="mailto:legal@getcmdr.com?subject=Renew%20my%20Cmdr%20updates"
                class="mb-4 block w-full rounded-lg bg-accent py-3 text-center font-medium text-accent-contrast transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-accent-hover"
            >
                Email to renew
            </a>

            <p class="text-center text-sm text-text-tertiary">
                You'll use the same license key, so no need to re-enter anything in the app.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 text-center">
            <a
                href="/pricing"
                class="text-accent-text underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent-hover"
            >
                View pricing →
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 rounded-lg border border-border-subtle bg-surface p-6">
            <h3 class="mb-2 font-semibold text-text-primary">Questions about your license?</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary">
                If you're having trouble renewing or need help with your license, email
                <a
                    href="mailto:legal@getcmdr.com"
                    class="text-accent-text underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent-hover"
                    >legal@getcmdr.com</a
                >. Happy to help.
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>
    <Footer />
</Layout>
